  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_de72bc97-157e-46f3-bed0-0807dfd868a0.png\"></p>\n<p>Early Bedtime 是一个简单的模组，允许模组包开发者和服务器管理员配置在服务器上允许提前睡觉的时间。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_93f153ef-0d6d-4929-98ad-7b61a9f5227b.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/nRQKp3Thsz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Luna%20Pixel&color=393939&labelColor=0843bf&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kS7auUeYmc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/901654795100749884?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=Txni&labelColor=36633c&color=393939\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/txnimc/EarlyBedtime\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Github&color=393939&labelColor=666666&style=for-the-badge&logo=Github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/txni/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=393939&labelColor=fb594a&style=for-the-badge&logo=CurseForge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fTxni\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=393939&labelColor=33de61&style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9970f929-e0f7-4f92-a5d5-4c35ed73d96a.png\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">此模组默认允许用户提前 1000 个刻（tick）睡觉，即大约 50 秒。您可以在模组的设置中进行配置。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">制作此模组的主要原因是，许多光影包的一个常见特性是夸张的日落效果，虽然看起来很棒，但也会让你想要更早睡觉！例如，使用 Hysteria 光影时，天色会很快变暗，但原版游戏直到太阳落到地平线以下才会变得足够黑以允许睡觉。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ea2AUB4.jpeg\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/U5SXa7o.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>",
